---
description: Writing and editing documentation pages in this repository
globs: docs/**/*.md,docs/**/*.mdx,**/README.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs-as-code/style-guide.md`.

- One Diataxis type per page (tutorial, how-to, reference, explanation), named in the front matter.
- Professional, direct tone. No hype words. No secrets in any example.
- Commands are copy-pasteable; un-run output is labelled "example output".
- Relative links only; run `build.sh docs` to check them.
- When unsure of a flag, key or version, write "check the docs" instead of guessing.
